{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Prince of Darkness Jr.",
    "steam_appid": 3716870,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716870/extras/a6406688a3f90b7c4d7d0d63dba34e4d.avif?t=1753224701\" data-has-big width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prince of Darkness Jr.</strong> is a block-pushing puzzle game where you can't step into the light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squatters are moving into Castle Darkness and turning on all the old gas lamps. It's up to the young Prince to get around the castle and stop them from taking over his home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move blocks to cast shadows and open doors in over 200 fiendishly tricky levels. Find secrets, experiment with new mechanics, watch out for danger, and get to the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716870/extras/910f8178737bf7775eeb456f31726f9c.avif?t=1753224701\" data-has-big width=800 height=664 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created as part of the 1-Bit Game Jam 2023.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716870/extras/a6406688a3f90b7c4d7d0d63dba34e4d.avif?t=1753224701\" data-has-big width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prince of Darkness Jr.</strong> is a block-pushing puzzle game where you can't step into the light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squatters are moving into Castle Darkness and turning on all the old gas lamps. It's up to the young Prince to get around the castle and stop them from taking over his home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move blocks to cast shadows and open doors in over 200 fiendishly tricky levels. Find secrets, experiment with new mechanics, watch out for danger, and get to the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716870/extras/910f8178737bf7775eeb456f31726f9c.avif?t=1753224701\" data-has-big width=800 height=664 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created as part of the 1-Bit Game Jam 2023.</p>",
    "short_description": "It's 'Vamps vs Lamps' in this box-pushing, shadow-casting, mind-bending puzzle game. Push blocks, open doors, smash windows, and discover secrets -- but whatever you do, don't touch the light!",
